STATEMENT OF KARAN MEHRA, RECORDED 20 FEBRUARY 2024

I am employed as a driver by Zenith Holdings. On 14 February 2024 I received a telephone call from Mr Vikram Malhotra. He told me he was in Dubai and asked me to hand the keys of vehicle DL-04-E-5544 to Mr Rahul Sharma. I did so at about five in the evening. I did not see Mr Malhotra at any time that day.

I do not know where the vehicle went afterwards.